  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/12345678/Reuters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Updated On Oct 8, 2026 at 07:38 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Pennsylvania's health department on Wednesday reported 145 new measles cases over the past week, bringing the total to 1,078, as the state continues to grapple with a rapidly growing outbreak.Five Pennsylvania residents have diedafter contracting the highly contagious disease this year, as cases in the US climb to their highest in more than three decades.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>So far, 207 people with reported measles infections in Pennsylvania have been hospitalized, according to the health department's websiteThose below 18 years of age accounted for 33% of total cases and less than 1% of patients were fully vaccinated</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Lancaster County remained the hardest-hit, with 401 reported measles infections as of WednesdayThe US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention has confirmed two measles-related deaths in the country this year, without naming the states</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Last month, the CDC shifted to using mortality data from the National Center for Health Statistics for measles-related deaths, rather than relying on state health departments, a change that has drawn scrutinyThe CDC has also said it is working with state epidemiologists on a standard definition for measles-related deathsAs of October 1, the latest federal data available, the US has reported 3,887 measles cases this year</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Measles is a highly contagious viral disease but can be prevented with the measles, mumps and rubella vaccine, which is about 97% effective after two doses.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                    \n\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/12345678/Reuters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reuters</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 8, 2026 at 07:38 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 8, 2026 at 07:32 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                              